        title: "Choose a free AI writing tool",
        content: "Go to one of these websites in your browser: chat.openai.com (ChatGPT), gemini.google.com (Google Gemini), or copilot.microsoft.com (Microsoft Copilot). All three are free. Create a free account with your email address if prompted.",
