        content: "Take the final draft and add at least one sentence in your own words that the AI could not have known. This is the secret to making an AI-assisted note feel real. Examples: \"Your hug at the end of the day made my whole week,\" or \"I have not laughed that hard since your grandfather was alive,\" or \"The blue color of the scarf reminded me of the dress I wore on our first dance.\" Now write the final note by hand on a card or stationery. Handwriting takes a few minutes longer. But it makes the note a keepsake instead of a piece of paper. Sign your name at the bottom the way you always do, and add the date if you like. Address the envelope, add a stamp, and put it in the mail today if you can.",
